## 🛠 TECH STACK

| Capa | Tecnología | Versión | Notas |
|------|-----------|---------|-------|
| Runtime | Python | 3.11+ | — |
| Framework web | Flask | 3.x | Backend |
| Templates | Jinja2 | — | Incluido con Flask |
| Base de datos | MySQL (XAMPP local) | 8.x | 10 tablas con FK cascades; schema en database/schema.sql |
| Driver BD | PyMySQL | 1.2.0 | mysql+pymysql://root:@localhost:3306/symbioenergia |
| ORM | SQLAlchemy (Flask-SQLAlchemy) | 2.x | Patrón: db.session.execute(select(Model)).scalars().all() |
| CSS | Puro + BEM | — | Sin frameworks CSS |
| Gráficas | Chart.js | 4.x | Scripts cliente |
| 3D viewer | Three.js | 0.163.0 | ES modules via importmap |
| Mapa | Mapbox GL JS | 3.4.0 | Mapa 3D con fill-extrusion, terrain, fog |
| Geocodificación | Nominatim (OSM) | — | Gratuito, 1 req/s |
| Edificios OSM | Overpass API | — | Footprints para 3D |
| Package manager | pip | — | requirements.txt |
| Tests | pytest | 7.x | — |

