## 🔍 SYMBOL INDEX

### Entry points
| Símbolo | Ubicación | Descripción |
|---------|----------|-------------|
| `create_app` | `src/__init__.py:1` | Flask app factory |
| `run.py` | `run.py:1` | Boot script (`python run.py`) |

### Rutas web (Blueprint 'web')
| Ruta | Handler | Template |
|------|---------|----------|
| `GET /` | `web_routes.py:landing` | `pages/landing.html` |
| `GET /mapa` | `web_routes.py:dashboard` | `pages/dashboard.html` |
| `GET /estudio` | `web_routes.py:estudio` | `pages/estudio.html` |
| `GET /geo` | `web_routes.py:geo` | `pages/geo_analysis.html` |
| `GET /clima` | `web_routes.py:clima` | `pages/climate_analysis.html` |
| `GET /simbiosis` | `web_routes.py:simbiosis` | `pages/symbiosis.html` |
| `GET /normativa` | `web_routes.py:normativa` | `pages/regulatory.html` |
| `GET /financiero` | `web_routes.py:financiero` | `pages/financial.html` |
| `GET/POST /login` | `web_routes.py:login` → `auth_controller.login` | `pages/login.html` |
| `GET/POST /registro` | `web_routes.py:registro` → `auth_controller.registro` | `pages/login.html` |
| `GET /logout` | `web_routes.py:logout` | redirect / |
| `GET /mi-empresa` | `web_routes.py:mi_empresa` → `auth_controller.mi_empresa` | `pages/mi_empresa.html` |
| `GET /verificar-email/<token>` | `web_routes.py` → `auth_controller.verificar_email` | `pages/verificar_email.html` |
| `POST /reenviar-verificacion` | `web_routes.py` → `auth_controller.reenviar_verificacion` | `pages/verificar_email.html` |
| `GET /factura-mensual` | `web_routes.py:factura_mensual` | `pages/factura_mensual.html` — parámetros: lat, lon, kwp, company |
| `GET /contrato-ce` | `web_routes.py:contrato_ce` | `pages/contrato_ce.html` — parámetros: lat, lon, kwp, company |

### Rutas API (Blueprint 'api', prefix /api)
| Ruta | Handler | Parámetros | Devuelve |
|------|---------|-----------|---------|
| `GET /api/geo` | `api_routes.py:geo` | lat, lon | GeoAnalysis JSON |
| `GET /api/climate` | `api_routes.py:climate` | lat, lon | ClimateAnalysis JSON |
| `GET /api/symbiosis` | `api_routes.py:symbiosis` | lat, lon | SimbiosisResult JSON |
| `GET /api/regulatory` | `api_routes.py:regulatory` | lat, lon | RegulatoryResult JSON |
| `GET /api/financial` | `api_routes.py:financial` | lat, lon, kwh | FinancialResult JSON |
| `GET /api/building-summary` | `building_summary_controller.get_building_summary` | lat, lon | {building_name, solar_kwh_year, panel_count, co2, subsidy, registered_by} — rate 30/min |
| `POST /api/llm` | `llm_controller.ask_llm` | {prompt} | {response, provider, anonymization} — rate 20/h |
| `POST /api/llm/analysis` | `llm_controller.ask_analysis` | {analysis_type, location_data, analysis_id} | {structured, report, provider} — rate 20/h |
| `GET /api/llm/health` | `api_routes.py:llm_health` | — | {ollama, groq, active} |
| `POST /api/companies` | `company_controller.register_company` | {name, lat, lon, ...} | {id} — requiere sesión, 1/user |
| `GET /api/companies` | `company_controller.get_companies` | lat, lon, radius_km | {companies:[]} |
| `POST /api/user/company` | `auth_controller.update_company_data` | session + {lat,lon,...} | {ok:true} — NO sobreescribe company_name |
| `POST /api/analysis/save` | `analysis_save_controller.save_analysis` | {geo,climate,financial,symbiosis,llm,lat,lon} | {analysis_id} |
| `GET /api/user/analyses` | `analysis_save_controller.get_user_analyses` | session | {analyses:[]} — últimos 20 |

